"Build ShikhokPlus: a native Android app plus backend for private tuition management in Bangladesh. Teachers manage batches, students, schedules, topic logs, exams/marksheets, and month-end fee collection; students and guardians get read-only visibility plus payment submission. Phone number is the account; role (teacher/student/guardian) is a lens resolved at read time, not a field. Strict privacy boundary: nothing a student or guardian writes is ever visible to a teacher. V1 excludes coaching centres, tutor marketplace, batch messaging, and PWA, but the architecture must absorb them without rework. Includes cross-batch dues screen, fee cycles with carry-forward/waiver, teacher payment verification, Bangla+English localization, and Google Play readiness (Data Safety, children's data policy, account deletion)."
